## Troubleshooting
### GCC version
Seed2Lp needs a gcc version >= 7. 


> 💻 Linux Commands:
>
> **Check your version:**
>```
>gcc --version
>```
>
> **Install latest version (here v11):**
>```
> sudo apt install gcc-11
>```
>
> **Link to the latest version (here v11):**
>```
> sudo update-alternatives --install /usr/bin/gcc gcc /usr/bin/gcc-11 20
>```
> **Check your version:**
>```
>gcc --version
>```
